cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "humanizar-es: local AI text humanizer for Spanish and English"
abstract: >-
  Four-stage pipeline that rewrites AI-generated text (Spanish or English) with a local base
  model without chat training (Qwen3-4B-Base + HIP adapter), guards fidelity (concepts,
  quotations, invented references, copying), rebuilds the rhythm of each paragraph in blocks
  of uneven length, and selects among several base-model candidates for the paragraphs a
  detector still flags. Measured: 0% in Grammarly, 0% in ZeroGPT and 0% AI / 98% human in
  GPTZero on a 1,990-word essay.
authors:
  - alias: ervin-mo
